<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\竹林黒霧.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> seemed to understand what I was thinking too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One wrong step and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would attack us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is more dangerous than I imagined...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">After all, this is someone who pushed for two children to be killed in Megasawa.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That was when it became clear to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was beheaded to make it look like a murder.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Stage a plain suicide in a baffling way, scatter distrust and grudges all over the Arata settlement, and brainwash the residents to make them easier for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to manipulate.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In a state like that, a single tip-off is enough to start them killing each other.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">In the first few years of curse-killings, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> may have done the killing with his own hands, but this also explains the confinement </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was kept in for 3 years from Shiyo 793.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All it takes is quietly telling someone 'That one's the culprit' and tacking on some convenient reasoning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The target back then was probably someone who had realized </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was the culprit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s doubters get killed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">It makes people think it's a grudge protecting </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the grudge of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Gradually, more and more people came to truly believe in the curse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And brainwashing even </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">his own daughters</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... he's like a devil...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ夏菜抱き合う.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then, suddenly, </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> threw her arms around </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm sorry, <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>...! I'm sorry...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And she began to apologize.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"I'm sure I'm to blame too for <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan's mom</STYLE> dying...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">―what is she thinking!? This is the most dangerous thing she could do!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If she says something like that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">that's how it is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="5">, get away from her, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> kept her arms around </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and wouldn't let go.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">can't forgive the culprit, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2">, you're not the culprit, are you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I mean, </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2">, you're so nice, there's no way you're the culprit..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> hugged </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> back.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2">, what did you do in Megasawa 10 years ago? Did you try to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's... not what happened, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then, </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2">, it isn't your fault."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had looked to me, if only for a moment, like a killing machine or something, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She was more rational than I'd thought.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2">, do you know who the culprit is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Will you tell me? I want to know why </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> died..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE>... what do I do...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I... this past New Year's, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and I had a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="けんか">fight</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, because </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said the one behind the curse-killings was </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What...!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had known...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> couldn't do anything about it alone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Earlier, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had said the mood in the settlement got worse every time she came back home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That way, she couldn't ask anyone outside the Niimura main family for help.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">All the more so if a faction opposing the Niimura main family really existed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had passed us those few scraps of hints in that way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, having seen the outside world, must have felt something was off about </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, who'd been making them train in what looked like killing techniques.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The ghost story earlier must have been a hint from </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">'Beware of someone close to you who'll try to </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="だま">deceive</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> you'...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it, that fortune-telling part had nothing to do with a ghost story at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="5">, let's talk. We have to explain it properly to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... all right...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> said that and drew away from </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So it really is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> who did it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Why did he kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I won't hate </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so... tell me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And also..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tumbling1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> faced </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> and pressed her head down to the futon.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2">, I'm sorry! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If I'd listened to what </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said...! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi-chan's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE>... It's the same for us. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> died because we..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, that's not true! </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, you two only wanted to help </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―Choosing words </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> could understand as best I could, I explained why we'd deduced that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was the culprit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">For a 10-year-old girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it was far too cruel a story.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had asked us to tell her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So I answered in kind and told her everything, hiding nothing.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE><BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't panic, didn't cry...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She just seemed to be quietly holding down the feelings welling up from her heart.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">do my best... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">strong...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> stood up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Do her best? Strong?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> opened the closet and was taking something out.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What she took out of it was...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In both hands, two knives.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Holding them, she came toward us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was it still too soon, after all, for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to understand?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She's going to turn those knives on us...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hup."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Still holding the knives, she sat down on the futon.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She stayed like that, staring at one spot, not moving.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So she doesn't mean to turn the knives on us...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"If it really is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> who did it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2"> will both be targets, won't they...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"............!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How could I not have noticed something this simple...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is a guy who tried to sacrifice grade-schoolers to a drug experiment, and who'd even brainwash his own </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">daughters</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Having likewise stopped a murder in Megasawa, </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> could easily be targets!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, the same goes for me, now that I'm getting close to the truth!</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then, suddenly, I heard thumping footsteps from the hallway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE>Natsumi-chan<STYLE ID="2">, get behind me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> stood up and took a stance.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\戦い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\swish1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜ナイフ2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll protect everyone, for sure! I'm strong!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
